flowchart TD

    A[Doctor Updates Availability] --> B[Elastic Schedule Adjustment]

    B --> C{Adjustment Type}

    %% Reduce
    C -->|Reduce Availability Window| D[Validate Updated Time Range]
    D --> E{Existing Bookings Outside New Range?}

    E -->|Yes| F[Reject Update or Request Rescheduling]
    E -->|No| G[Update Availability Window]
    G --> H[Regenerate appointment Slots]
    H --> I[Publish Updated Schedule]

    %% Extend
    C -->|Extend Availability Window| J[Validate Updated Time Range]
    J --> K[Extend Working Hours]
    K --> L[Generate Additional appointment Slots]
    L --> M[Preserve Existing appointments]
    M --> N[Publish Updated Schedule]

    style A fill:#E3F2FD
    style B fill:#FFF3E0
    style C fill:#F3E5F5
    style I fill:#E8F5E9
    style N fill:#E8F5E9
    style F fill:#FFEBEE